# CVE-2026-14456 (libcrypto3/libssl3, HIGH): DoS via unbounded memory growth
# in OpenSSL's QUIC server. Fixed upstream in 3.5.8-r0, but that build hasn't
# reached the official node:22.23.2-alpine image yet, so no digest we can pin
# to carries the fix. This service never speaks QUIC/HTTP3 (plain
# http.createServer over TCP), so it isn't reachable through this service.
# Revisit on the next base-image bump.
CVE-2026-14456
